# ===========================================================================
# Medical imaging data and labels -- NEVER commit.
# Large, provider-licensed, and potentially identifiable. The participant IDs
# in this dataset are pseudonymised, which is NOT the same as being cleared
# for redistribution.
# ===========================================================================
PDCADxFoundation_*/
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.nrrd
*.dcm
*.dicom
*.mha
*.mhd
*.zip

# ===========================================================================
# Derived data produced by the preprocessing scripts.
# Both are reproducible from the raw data; both are far too large to commit.
#   cache/      <- scripts/build_baseline_cache.py and friends
#   processed/  <- scripts/prepare_labels.py + scripts/normalize_images.py
# ===========================================================================
cache/
processed/

# Synthetic smoke-test fixture written by scripts/make_synthetic_data.py.
# Regenerate it with that script; it is deterministic.
tests/_synthetic_data/

# ===========================================================================
# Local-only documentation.
# LOCAL_RUN_GUIDE.md documents this machine's working setup (environment,
# where the data lives, how to re-run things). LOCAL_QUICKSTART.md is the
# short version of the same. Both are for local / group use and must NOT be
# published. REFACTORING_NOTES.md is the internal record of how the repo was
# trimmed; it is development history, not part of the public project.
# ===========================================================================
LOCAL_RUN_GUIDE.md
LOCAL_QUICKSTART.md
REFACTORING_NOTES.md

# ===========================================================================
# Model weights and prediction arrays.
# ===========================================================================
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.h5

# ===========================================================================
# Case-level records -- NEVER commit.
# The split manifests, the per-case result tables and the top-level case lists
# all name real participant cases. Pseudonymised IDs are still participant
# data: this repository has no redistribution right over them. The aggregate
# numbers quoted in README.md are the only results that belong in the public
# repo. Everything here stays on disk for local use.
# ===========================================================================
manifests/
results/
train_cases.csv
val_cases.csv

# ===========================================================================
# Logs and reports regenerated by a run.
# ===========================================================================
*.log
results/**/run.log

# ===========================================================================
# Python
# ===========================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ===========================================================================
# Secrets and local machine configuration.
# ===========================================================================
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
credentials*.json
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===========================================================================
# OS
# ===========================================================================
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
